    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE CONFERMENT OF THE HONOUR OF SENIORINSTRUCTING ATTORNEYS-AT-LAW WITH A VIEW TO RECOGNIZING",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      248.09,
      401.85,
      259.43
    ],
    "text": "AND APPRECIATING THE SERVICE RENDERED BY ATTORNEYS-AT-LAW",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      259.49,
      401.85,
      270.83
    ],
    "text": "PRACTICING AS INSTRUCTING ATTORNEYS WHO HAVE DEMONSTRATED",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      270.89,
      401.85,
      282.23
    ],
    "text": "EMINENCE AND HIGH STANDARDS IN THE LEGAL PROFESSION; AND TO",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      282.29,
      401.73,
      293.63
    ],
    "text": "PROVIDE FOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      296.42,
      202.29,
      304.36
    ],
    "text": "THERETO",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      316.49,
      401.9,
      339.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      350.69,
      401.87,
      373.43
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Conferring the Honour ofSenior Instructing Attorneys-at-Law Act, No. \u2026\u2026. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      384.89,
      401.88,
      453.23
    ],
    "text": "2. (1) His Exellency the President may, after obtainingobservations from the Chief Justice and the Minister assignedthe subject of Justice, confer the honour of Senior InstructingAttorney-at-Law on any Attorney-at-Law of the SupremeCourt of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lankawho-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      464.69,
      401.89,
      498.83
    ],
    "text": "(a)has been in active practice as an InstructingAttorney for a period not less than thirty-five yearsas at the date of conferring such honour;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      510.29,
      401.88,
      544.43
    ],
    "text": "(b)has reached eminence in the legal profession andhas maintained high standards of conduct andprofessional rectitude;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      555.89,
      401.89,
      578.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)has not been found guilty of any criminal offenceunder any written law;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      590.09,
      401.87,
      647.03
    ],
    "text": "(d)has not been found guilty of any professionalmisconduct under the Supreme Court (Conduct ofand Etiquette for Attorneys-at-Law) Rules 1988 andthe provisions of the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978;and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      659.09,
      390.83,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(e)has been a person of good character and repute.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      375.07,
      192.23
    ],
    "text": "2Conferring the Honour of Senior InstructingAttorneys-at-Law",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      141.19,
      264.89,
      146.19,
      276.23
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      354.41,
      149.59,
      365.75
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      203.09,
      397.2,
      251.39
    ],
    "text": "(2) His Excellency the President shall, upon conferringthe honour of Senior Instructing Attorney-at-Law to anyInstructing Attorney, hand over a certificate to that effect tosuch Instructing Attorney.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.15,
      264.65,
      382.9,
      275.99
    ],
    "text": "3. In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      196.15,
      291.77,
      397.2,
      340.91
    ],
    "text": "\u201cInstructing Attorney\u201d means an Attorney-at-Lawwhose main practice is to instruct a Counselto appear in court on the instructions of suchAttorney-at-Law.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      355.61,
      397.18,
      380.51
    ],
    "text": "4. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      266.59,
      451.16,
      275.66
    ],
    "text": "Interpretation",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
